  "summary": "Local macOS test-only candidate diagnosis and separate direct-grid, full banded, ranked and checked-order handoff cost campaigns. Six fresh paired optimized processes compare independent ranked versus handoff, with alternating pair order, one warmup and three samples per route, exact receipts and all raw timings. Handoff reduces layered-tiny four fits/sixteen checks to three/twelve and recovery median 87.619 to 62.289 ms; other five cases keep two fits/eight checks and have 0.0 to 2.9 percent slower recovery medians. Formal chain caps drop four/twenty-six to three/twenty and summed grid reservation 1,347,092,480 to 1,011,548,160. Historical full/ranked tiny-layer regression and long tail remain retained, not replaced. Actual certificate callbacks and scoped reservations exclude preparation/operator checks/polish/reference work; process RSS includes both routes, not separate incremental heaps. No universal speedup/SLO, complete production budget, public admission, remote Agent or release maturity is claimed.",
